# AutoPM project record. Plain text on purpose: it is meant to be read
# and diffed. Keys are screen.field, matching the files in definitions/.
# provenance is one of specified, agreed, unobjected. Anything else is
# untagged, and only specified and agreed count as decisions.

project: demo
name: Demo: Library Room Booking
accent: #B05CF6
created: 2026-09-01
modified: 2026-09-25
phase: Executing
summary: |
  A worked example. The library, the people and the project are invented.
  It is filled in the way a real record would be, partway through Executing,
  so every screen has something to read against its help panel.

  Closeout is empty on purpose: the project has not closed. Delete this record
  whenever you like; your own projects are unaffected.
