field board.definition_of_done
  provenance: agreed
  evidence: Sprint planning, 2026-09-14
  value: |
    Meets its acceptance test, checked by someone other than the person who built
    it. Works on a phone and a desk computer. The staff guide is updated if staff
    see the change.
field board.sprint_goal
  provenance: agreed
  evidence: Sprint 2 planning, 2026-09-25
  value: |
    Sprint 2: staff can run every booking, web and phone, from one calendar, so
    the pilot can start on 10-12 with the binder retired.
