field charter.out_of_scope
  provenance: specified
  evidence: Dana, charter review 2026-09-08: "No money handling. That's a council matter."
  value: |
    Payments or room hire fees. Booking equipment or study carrels. Changes to the
    rest of the website. A mobile app.
field charter.overall_risk
  provenance: agreed
  evidence: Charter review, 2026-09-08
  value: |
    Low to moderate. The technology is off the shelf; the real exposure is County
    IT's approval of the plugin, which we do not control and which sits on the
    critical path.
field charter.pm_authority
  provenance: specified
  evidence: Dana, charter review 2026-09-08
  value: |
    Sam can spend up to $200 of contingency without asking, assign volunteer and
    desk time within the agreed pilot hours, and change configuration and wording.
    Anything that moves a milestone, spends more, or changes who can book goes to
    Dana.
field charter.purpose
  provenance: agreed
  evidence: Charter review, 2026-09-08
  value: |
    Let patrons book the library's two meeting rooms online, from one shared
    calendar the front desk also uses, so bookings stop depending on opening hours
    and the paper binder.
field charter.sponsor
  provenance: specified
  evidence: Staff meeting, 2026-09-01
  value: Dana Reyes, branch manager.
field charter.success_criteria
  provenance: agreed
  evidence: Charter review, 2026-09-08
  row s1
    cell criterion
      value: Patrons book rooms online instead of by phone or at the desk.
    cell measure
      value: At least 80% of November bookings made through the website, from the booking log.
    cell ref
      value: S1
  row s2
    cell criterion
      value: No double bookings.
    cell measure
      value: Zero double-booked slots in the six weeks after launch, from the desk incident log.
    cell ref
      value: S2
  row s3
    cell criterion
      value: Front desk time on bookings drops.
    cell measure
      value: Under 1 hour a week, from a two-week time sample taken in November.
    cell ref
      value: S3
  row s4
    cell criterion
      value: Live before the winter programme starts.
    cell measure
      value: Public booking page live on or before 2026-11-02.
    cell ref
      value: S4
