field intake.need
  provenance: agreed
  evidence: Summary confirmed by Dana, 2026-09-03
  value: |
    Patrons can only reserve a meeting room by phoning or visiting during opening
    hours, and the paper binder at the front desk is the only record. Staff spend
    about five hours a week taking bookings, and two double bookings in August
    turned groups away at the door.
field intake.options
  provenance: agreed
  evidence: Options review with Dana, 2026-09-04
  row o1
    cell benefit
      value: No change for regulars who like phoning.
    cell cost
      value: No money. About 5 staff hours a week continues.
    cell option
      value: Do nothing: keep the binder
    cell ref
      value: O1
    cell risk
      value: More double bookings as winter demand rises.
    cell verdict
      value: Do-nothing baseline
  row o2
    cell benefit
      value: Patrons book online; staff see one calendar; runs on hosting we already have.
    cell cost
      value: $600 licence for the first year, plus volunteer build time.
    cell option
      value: Booking plugin on the library's existing website
    cell ref
      value: O2
    cell risk
      value: Depends on County IT approving the plugin.
    cell verdict
      value: Recommended
  row o3
    cell benefit
      value: Fastest to set up.
    cell cost
      value: About $90 a month, ongoing.
    cell option
      value: Hosted booking service (monthly subscription)
    cell ref
      value: O3
    cell risk
      value: Patron data held by a third party; ongoing cost outlives the budget.
    cell verdict
      value: Rejected
  row o4
    cell benefit
      value: Fits exactly.
    cell cost
      value: Months of volunteer time.
    cell option
      value: Custom-built booking app
    cell ref
      value: O4
    cell risk
      value: Nobody to maintain it after the volunteer leaves.
    cell verdict
      value: Rejected
field intake.request
  provenance: specified
  evidence: Staff meeting notes, 2026-09-01
  value: |
    Dana Reyes, branch manager, at the staff meeting on 2026-09-01: "The room
    sign-up binder is costing the desk half a day a week and we double-booked the
    community room twice in August. Find me something better before the winter
    programme starts."
