field quality.assurance
  provenance: agreed
  evidence: Quality plan, 2026-09-12
  value: |
    Sam reviews test results at each sprint review. Priya runs the pilot and owns
    the incident log. County IT runs the accessibility check. Nobody signs off
    their own configuration.
