field quality.standard
  provenance: agreed
  evidence: Quality plan, agreed with Dana 2026-09-12
  value: |
    Every Must requirement passes its acceptance test before the pilot, tested by
    someone other than the person who configured it. The public page passes the
    county's WCAG 2.1 AA check before launch.
field requirements.assumptions
  provenance: agreed
  evidence: Requirements workshop, 2026-09-10
  value: |
    Most regular groups have someone with an email address. (Checked with the
    Friends of the Library: true for all but two groups, who will keep phoning.)
    The plugin's free tier does not cover two rooms, so the paid licence is needed.
    Leo can give about six hours a week until launch.
field requirements.constraints
  provenance: specified
  evidence: Charter, and County IT hosting policy
  value: |
    Must run on the library's existing website, hosted by the county.
    County IT approves every plugin and change to the live site.
    Budget capped at $1,200.
    Live by 2026-11-02, before the winter programme.
    No patron data leaves county hosting.
