field risks.thresholds
  provenance: agreed
  evidence: Risk workshop, 2026-09-12
  value: |
    Any risk rated High impact gets an owner and a response before the next sprint
    starts. Anything that would move launch past 2026-11-02 goes to Dana the same
    day. Medium-impact risks are reviewed at the sprint review; Low ones monthly.
