field schedule.baseline
  provenance: agreed
  evidence: Baseline 2026-09-12; revision approved with CR1, 2026-09-22
  value: |
    Baselined 2026-09-12 with launch on 2026-11-02. The pilot originally ended
    on 10-16; CR1 (2026-09-22) moved it to 10-23 to add phone bookings. Launch
    did not move: the week came out of the slack before 11-02.
field schedule.basis
  provenance: agreed
  evidence: Schedule review, 2026-09-12
  value: |
    Configuration estimated by Leo from the plugin's setup guide at six hours a
    week. County IT's approval estimated at two weeks from their last two plugin
    requests. The pilot is two weeks because one week would miss the fortnightly
    groups.
field scope.acceptance_criteria
  provenance: agreed
  evidence: Scope review, 2026-09-11
  value: |
    Every Must requirement meets its acceptance test. The two-week staff pilot
    runs with no double booking. Priya signs off that the desk can use it unaided.
    County IT's accessibility check passes.
field scope.exclusions
  provenance: agreed
  evidence: Scope review, 2026-09-11
  value: |
    Fees and payments. Equipment booking. Patron accounts or logins. Any change to
    other website pages. Recurring bookings are a Could (R9) and will be dropped
    first if time runs short.
field scope.product_scope
  provenance: agreed
  evidence: Scope review, 2026-09-11
  value: |
    A booking page on the library website listing the community room (40 people)
    and the study room (8 people), with a calendar of free slots in 30-minute
    steps during opening hours. Patrons book with name, email and group. Staff
    manage all bookings, including phone bookings, from one calendar. Confirmation
    and reminder emails go to the booker.
