field sprints.cadence
  provenance: agreed
  evidence: Agreed with Leo and Dana, 2026-09-11
  value: |
    Two-week sprints, Monday to Friday week two. Two weeks because Leo works about
    six hours a week: one week would hold too little to demo.
field sprints.definition_of_ready
  provenance: agreed
  evidence: Sprint planning, 2026-09-14
  value: |
    The card says what the patron or staff member can do when it is finished, has
    acceptance written, is sized in points, and has nothing waiting on County IT.
