field stakeholders.strategy
  provenance: agreed
  evidence: Stakeholder session, 2026-09-09
  value: |
    County IT: high power, low interest, and unaware. Sam meets them before the
    build, with the plugin's security notes, so approval is a known date rather
    than a surprise. This is the biggest gap on the register.

    Priya: involve her in the pilot design and let her team set the desk
    workflow, so the system is hers rather than imposed.

    Friends of the Library: phone booking stays (R6). Tell them at their October
    meeting rather than letting them find out at launch.
