field status.summary
  provenance: agreed
  evidence: Status report, 2026-09-25
  value: |
    On track for launch on 2026-11-02. Amber because the pilot needs County IT to
    allow emails from the county mail server by 10-12, and that is not in our
    hands. If it misses, the pilot runs without reminders and launch holds.
